    <Title>Deploy &quot;Wincollect&quot; using KC EP &quot;10.150.126.8&quot; for Win 64 bit</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[This task will download 1 files from the "Wincollect" Software Distribution Package onto selected endpoints <BR><BR><B>Installation Command:</B> "AGENT_x64_WinCollect-7.2.2.1018564-setup.exe" /s /v" /qn INSTALLDIR="C:\IBM\WinCollect" AUTHTOKEN=804e50fb-7cef-4cd0-bfc9-21462be576b6 FULLCONSOLEADDRESS=10.150.126.8:8413 HOSTNAME={hostname} LOG_SOURCE_AUTO_CREATION_ENABLED=True LOG_SOURCE_AUTO_CREATION_PARAMETERS=""Component1.AgentDevice=DeviceWindowsLog&amp;Component1.Action=create&amp;Component1.LogSourceName={hostname}&amp;Component1.LogSourceIdentifier={addresses of adapters whose (cidr string of it = wake on lan subnet cidr string) of network}&amp;Component1.Destination.Name=10.150.126.8&amp;Component1.CoalesceEvents=False&amp;Component1.StoreEventPayload=True&amp;Component1.Encoding=UTF-8&amp;Component1.Log.Application=True&amp;Component1.Log.Security=True&amp;Component1.Log.System=True&amp;Component1.Log.DNS+Server=False&amp;Component1.Log.Directory+Service=False&amp;Component1.Log.File+Replication+Service=False"""<BR><BR><B>Run Command As:</B> System User<BR><BR><B>Download Size:</B> 20,701.6 KB ]]></Description>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[version of client >= "8.2"]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system AND (if( name of operating system starts with &quot;Win&quot; ) then platform id of operating system != 3 else true)</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[(if(name of operating system starts with "Win") then free space of drive of client > 42396806 else if ((mac of it) of operating system) then free space of filesystem of folder (pathname of client) > 42396806 else free space of filesystem of client > 42396806)]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[version of client >= "8.1"]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance>/*Optional Target Marker*/ /* See KB Article swg21668807 (http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21668807) for more information. */ ( ((name of it as lowercase contains &quot;win&quot; as lowercase )) of operating system)</Relevance>
    <Relevance>(exists true whose (if true then (exists ((if (name of operating system as lowercase starts with &quot;win&quot;) then if (x64 of operating system) then &quot;x64&quot; else &quot;x32&quot; else &quot;Non-Windows OS&quot;)) whose (it as string as lowercase contains &quot;x64&quot; as lowercase)) else false))</Relevance>
